WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:07.800
With wedding-parent makeup, who does it is everything.

2
00:00:08.136 --> 00:00:14.952
Ten-plus years of experience isn't just time passing — it's real-world data built from thousands of faces.

3
00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:22.224
Wedding-parent makeup demands real skill in creating natural volume despite sagging muscle tone and thinning hair.

4
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:30.528
A veteran head artist with over a decade of experience can instantly read a parent's face shape and head shape, finding that one refined touch that avoids looking aged.

5
00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:37.392
A design shaped by a skilled, experienced hand shows a clear difference in refinement under the wedding hall lighting.

6
00:00:37.728 --> 00:00:47.472
Unlike skin and hair in your 20s or 30s, the condition of skin and hair in your 50s and 60s is transformed into a truly polished look through the hands of a more experienced veteran artist.
